BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 630.48 Tm ([ ] Run the spread test on every contract: assign deals at or under $10,000 and push anything above it, even $11,000,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 615.25 Tm (into a double escrow [Luigi Ontiveros - UpxkrBIxTtQ @ 00:01:10].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 593.02 Tm ([ ] Write a clause into both the seller and buyer contracts naming your investor-friendly title, escrow or attorney) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 577.80 Tm (company as the agreed closer [Flipping Mastery TV - Jfl-5LgDTaM @ 00:09:55].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 555.57 Tm ([ ] Build the right to assign to another entity you want to close with directly into every offer so assignment permission) Tj ET
