BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.70 Tm (tax proration a buyer owes the seller, so the buyer must plan more cash than the lender estimated, and that a title) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 147.47 Tm (company hold and pay typically collects about 115% of the prior year's bill plus a $60 to $100 tax payment service fee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 132.25 Tm ([faIlHE0Vtco @ 00:11:22]. Felsman adds a twist for anyone who negotiates hard: if the seller pays 100% of closing) Tj ET
