BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 468.00 Tm (Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.77 Tm (The first failure mode is the money partner who stops funding mid-deal. Clint Coons describes a gap funder who wires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 430.55 Tm ($20K, leaves the project $25K short, and lets the hard money lender foreclose before a breach suit can even be filed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.32 Tm (Time pressure compounds it. A Florida LLC was still incomplete on day 6 of a 10-day close and had to be replaced the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.10 Tm (same day by a Wyoming LLC, which carries $50 a year in costs [6bibMzU1L3U @ 00:10:04]. The second failure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 384.87 Tm (mode is a runaway operator. Coons's walkthrough cites a $400K demolition horror story. The responses are to bar Party) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 369.65 Tm (B from exceeding the budget by $8K without approval, and to force a listing within 7 days of completion. Price drops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 354.42 Tm (are scripted at 8%, then 5% at 60, 90 and 120 days, down to a $490K break-even floor, after which the property) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.20 Tm (converts to a rental [FiBdpAVfzMo @ 00:25:12]. Scott Horne flags the structural trap: a JV built only to dodge usury) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 323.97 Tm (limits is a sham. The funder has to genuinely participate or hold real ownership in the LLC or on the deed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 308.75 Tm ([XdrwPF-D1FI @ 00:08:27]. Molly Tennant adds that breach is pursued separately, so breach disclosures belong in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 293.52 Tm (agreement up front [TTA8OtC6qJs @ 00:01:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.30 Tm (Closing-table failures are where private lenders lose principal without any borrower default. Jason at Hard Money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.07 Tm (Mastermind refuses powers of attorney and remote online notaries, and reminds lenders that the title company does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.85 Tm (represent them. He verifies the title commitment directly with the insurer. He wires only after the HUD-1 and a signed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 232.62 Tm (three-to-four-page closing instruction letter are in hand [bNJYDcDSFxU @ 00:17:38]. Manuel Angelus at The Real) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 217.40 Tm (Estate Lender puts it bluntly: an unrecorded lien is a secret between friends. A $38 recording fee is what sets priority,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.17 Tm (and property taxes still jump ahead of everyone [Bp3FsnPecRY @ 00:02:26]. Angelus also warns that insurance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 186.95 Tm (quietly fails mid-loan. Vacancy exclusions kick in at 30 to 60 days, builder's risk may be missing, and flood leaves) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.72 Tm (gaps. The lender has to be named mortgagee and loss payee and must reverify coverage during the term, not just at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 156.50 Tm (closing [Bp3FsnPecRY @ 00:05:58]. William Dolan of Esquire Advice raises the authority trap. Operating agreements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 141.27 Tm (often list stale managers, so the person signing for the borrowing LLC may have no power to bind it. And once) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 126.05 Tm (bankruptcy hits, unsecured lenders collect little [hy-UeKXcTUA @ 00:04:29].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 110.82 Tm (Rate and default math is the third trap, and it cuts both ways. Ayala Law's live trial involved a $5M balloon loan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 95.60 Tm (Delayed refinancing let 21% default interest accrue daily, and a new lender retroactively assessed default interest on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 80.37 Tm (past late payments under a no-waiver clause. The balance swelled to about $6.4M, and the lawsuit itself then blocked) Tj ET
