BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Steve Ferguson walks through the numbers on his preferred program, which is not a lien at all. It advances up to about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (70% of value at 0% interest with no restriction on use. It also keeps the departing residence out of DTI, provided the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (home is listed within a set period after closing [AGFnuSOGL68 @ 00:02:07]. In the worked example, a $500K home at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (70% equals $350K. Subtract $200K owed and $150K remains, which goes down on a $500K purchase, so the new loan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (is $350K. Any surplus at sale arrives as a separate check [AGFnuSOGL68 @ 00:04:22]. If the home sits unsold for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (four months, the program takes ownership and covers payments, taxes, insurance, and repairs. The fee is 2.4% or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ($9,000, whichever is higher. Eligibility is tight: conventional, FHA, VA, or USDA financing; five acres maximum with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (no exceptions; no subdivisions heavy with new construction; single-family only; good condition; and pretty good) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (credit. Ryan Marks runs the combined-LTV version. A $1M free-and-clear home plus a $2M purchase caps borrowing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (at $2.25M under the 75% ceiling, with one loan on two properties and 1 to 3 points [d8gbJrywXFE @ 00:01:06]. RJ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Baxter's 80% math differs: $500K times 80% is $400K, and subtracting $300K owed nets $100K [XH6IkQFi_8M @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (00:00:31].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Investor bridge pricing runs on experience tiers and seasoning. Easy Lending USA lends 75% to borrowers with two or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (more deals at FICO 620+, 72.5% with one deal, and 70% to new investors at FICO 650+. Loan sizes run from $115K) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (to $8M, with cash-out around 65% [GcefOZxHIAg @ 00:03:53]. In the worked deal, a $400K duplex closes in 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (days, bridged at 75% for $300K, which leaves roughly $100K plus costs to bring, with a DSCR refinance as the exit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (Seasoning decides the basis. Owned more than 12 months, the loan sizes off appraised value; owned less, it sizes off) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (cost basis, so keep every receipt [GcefOZxHIAg @ 00:04:35]. Zach Smith quotes private-money economics from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (lender seat. Investors expect 8 to 10%, so rates land at 11 to 12% with no index tie. Interest-only payments run roughly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (1% of balance per month, and max LTV is 70 to 75%, constrained by cash flow. Minimum FICO is 540) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm ([VIt86OFRY3Y @ 00:43:19]. Terms run 12 months for residential deals and 24 months plus a 24-month extension for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (commercial ones. Aravision Funding pitches the speed end of the market: closings in 3 to 5 days, interest-only, no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (prepayment penalties, no credit checks, no upfront fees, and a reply within one business day [4jdvXuchjXo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (00:01:01].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (On lines of credit, Fast Business Lending runs the cleanest math. On a $50K line with a $20K draw, interest applies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (only to the $20K. A bank line at prime plus margin costs about $583 over six months, while online lenders run $1,800) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (to $3,488. A "1.55% monthly fee" works out to roughly 31% APR [-EPbq7NKBZY @ 00:02:35]. Online lenders want) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (6 to 12 months in business and a score around 625; banks want two-plus years and 680+. The harder the underwriting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (barrier is to pass, the less the money costs. Velocity Channel's setup sequence is website first, then company-domain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (email at about $40 a month, then an EIN-backed bank account. The claim is that an owned domain moves approvals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (into five-digit lines of $10K to $50K+ instead of $3K to $5K [5IAt1l4ev5w @ 00:03:22]. Korean Atlanta Mentorship's) Tj ET
